{"version":1,"content":"<p>儘管《俠盜獵車手6》（GTA 6）獲得了極為積極的評價，但圍繞其性能問題的討論仍在網絡上持續升温。多份報告指出，這款畫面要求極高的遊戲似乎正在給部分老化PS5主機的液態金屬導熱材料帶來壓力。為改善體驗，一些PC玩家開始嘗試通過雲遊戲串流運行《GTA 6》，並在串流畫面中注入DLSS 5，藉助多幀生成技術將幀率提升至最高120幀。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587352.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.064145+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:25:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"9c3c125a612875d351db41af7c64977060e2c161cb4cc88b647a03c6d83277b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}